fixture hazard_loop_stick_held_floor_spikes
doc docs/adr/0010, hazards (movement review 4, M1): the same on level ground, walking right into a strip of floor spikes and holding right throughout. The respawn is at x 441 u, 39 u short of the strip at 480 u (safe ground keeps a tile clear of any hazard), and the held stick is ignored after the send-back, so Ash is not walked back onto the spikes. (It used to loop every 20 frames for as long as the stick was held.)
room test/spikes
spawn 300 512
frames 200
input
  0..199 R
end
expect
  mark die1 0..199 event.hazard=1
  never die1+1..die1+60 event.hazard=1
end
